            "sid": "GEN 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵapele upile ŵanduwo pakwasalila kuti, “Mŵelekane, mtupe, mgumbale mcilambo capasi, mcilamulile. Ngumpa ulamusi pa somba sya m'nyasa ni yijuni, ni yinyama yosope ya pa cilambo capasi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlungu ŵatite, “Ngumpa yakumela yosope yakusogola songolo yayili pa cilambo capasi, ni mtundu uliwose wacitela wakusogola yisogosi yana songolo, kuti mlyeje yeleyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo yinyama yosope ya pa cilambo capasi ni yijuni yosope ni yinyama yakwaŵa yosope ya pa cilambo capasi, nayipele manyasi ni masamba kuti yilyeje,” ni yatendekwe myoyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlungu ŵayiweni kuti yosope yiŵayipanganyisyeyo yaliji yambone mnope. Nipo kwaswele soni ni kwacele, ali lyaliji lisiku lya msano ni limo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.31"
            ]
          }
        }
